| `launcher.own_hosts_file` | string | `config/own-hosts.local.json` | a repo-relative POSIX path, no `..`, that `.gitignore` ignores and no symlink reaches | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `main` | Moves the git-ignored file whose `own_hosts` fnmatch patterns name the hosts that are one person's own; the launcher runs a long script as normal only on a host one matches. An absent, unreadable or malformed file, an empty list and a host no pattern matches all mean shared. A path git would list, or one reached through a symlink, is refused with exit 2. | a list of hosts in the repo: host names are never committed; `config/own-hosts.example.json` holds placeholders only | always |
